{"ID":"20240619185928-i07qq13","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240619185928-i07qq13","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185928-i07qq13\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185940-nr7w8pm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185940-7yv7zxc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185940-7yv7zxc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"谷芽（粟芽）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240619185940-uzst8ar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619185940-uzst8ar","updated":"20240619185940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t全国各地均产。\n【性状】\t果实呈稍扁的长椭圆形，顶部略尖，基部钝圆。长6"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9mm，宽约3mm。外种坚硬，表面黄色，具短细毛，有脉5条。基部有白色线形的浆片2枚，长约2mm，淡黄色，膜质，由一侧的浆片内伸出淡黄色弯曲的初生细须根，一侧有芽。内释薄膜状，光滑，黄白色，内藏果实，质坚，断面白色，有粉性。气无，味微甜。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t消食化积；健脾开胃。用于食积停滞；胀满泄泻；脾虚少食；脚气浮肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240619185940-brv7gus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619185940-brv7gus","updated":"20240619185940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095734-wi9uwf3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726163739-snqaj84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726163739-snqaj84","updated":"20240726163739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 465px;","style":"width: 455px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"粟米3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/粟米3-20240627134001-xmzpbu4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 455px;\" parent-style=\"width: 465px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726163739-5zxh176","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726163739-5zxh176","updated":"20240726163739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627133610-rpex75w.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726163739-y0fxprt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726163739-y0fxprt","updated":"20240726163925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 489px;","style":"width: 479px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"黍米2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/黍米2-20240627135853-4ifyovq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 479px;\" parent-style=\"width: 489px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726164358-9hhov4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726164358-9hhov4l","updated":"20240726164517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 396px;","style":"width: 386px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"粟米 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/粟米 3-20240726164449-4i2a87y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 386px;\" parent-style=\"width: 396px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 877px;","style":"width: 867px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"粟米 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/粟米 2-20240726164358-7i9uk6a.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 867px;\" parent-style=\"width: 877px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726163947-4j8h31y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726163947-4j8h31y","updated":"20240726164023"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 646px;","style":"width: 636px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"粟米"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/粟米-20240726164022-fbo0sgt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 636px;\" parent-style=\"width: 646px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 633px;","style":"width: 623px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627133631-d86td6s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 623px;\" parent-style=\"width: 633px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726163739-wgulkub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726163739-wgulkub","updated":"20240726164210"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"粟米 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/粟米 1-20240726164147-ypiaf52.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 564px;","style":"width: 554px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"粟米5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/粟米5-20240627134249-7d6d8vs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 554px;\" parent-style=\"width: 564px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240726163536-oq1nbup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240726163536-oq1nbup","updated":"20240726163554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：为粟的发芽作物；"}]},{"ID":"20240726163537-06kecat","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240726163537-06kecat"}},{"ID":"20240902174549-8amzv8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-8amzv8k","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：谷芽"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-1tfzwkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-1tfzwkh","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谷芽《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-a6ozdkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-a6ozdkg","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】GǔYá"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-pvrirhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-pvrirhw","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】FRUCTUSSETARIAEGERMINATUS"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-i3vy0yy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-i3vy0yy","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】粟芽"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-52d0od7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-52d0od7","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为禾本科植物粟Setariaitalica（L.）Beauv.的成熟果实经发芽干燥而得。将粟谷用水浸泡后，保持适宜的温、湿度，待须根长至约6mm时，晒干或低温干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-ckyskez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-ckyskez","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈类圆球形，直径约2mm,顶端钝圆，基部略尖。外壳为革质的稃片，淡黄色，具点状皱纹，下端有初生的细须根，长约3～6mm，剥去稃片，内含淡黄色或黄白色颖果（小米）1粒。无臭，味微甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-p08sjdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-p08sjdm","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-jbh5r6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-jbh5r6t","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谷芽：除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-rtebyc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-rtebyc5","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒谷芽：取净谷芽，照清炒法（附录ⅡD）炒至深黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-i72tv8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-i72tv8w","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"焦谷芽：取净谷芽，照清炒法（附录ⅡD）炒至焦褐色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-3t6dnp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-3t6dnp0","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-17dadnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-17dadnx","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-xr6qn3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-xr6qn3v","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】消食和中，健脾开胃。用于食积不消，腹胀口臭，脾胃虚弱，不饥食少。炒谷芽偏于消食，用于不饥食少。焦谷芽善化积滞，用于积滞不消。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-14e7rwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-14e7rwy","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】9～15g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-y7l948v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-y7l948v","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-ezayjtv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-ezayjtv","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-plgd59l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-plgd59l","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谷芽《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-ezv5reu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-ezv5reu","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-j15knfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-j15knfz","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】GǔYá"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-xiv8mhe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-xiv8mhe","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】蘖米（《别录》），谷蘖（《澹寮方》），稻蘖（《纲目》），稻芽（《中药材手册》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-qc47ugo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-qc47ugo","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为禾本科植物稻的成熟果实，经加工而发芽者。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-mofci0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-mofci0p","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】全国产稻区均有生产，而以南方早稻谷加工的谷芽为好。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-8cx1ldq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-8cx1ldq","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制法】取拣净的稻谷，用水浸泡1～2天，捞出置容器中，上盖潮湿蒲包，每日淋水，保持湿润，至初生根（俗称芽）长约3～6毫米时，取出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-6yrqf8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-6yrqf8d","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥的谷芽，呈长椭圆形而扁，两端略尖，长7～9毫米，宽3～4毫米，外稃包围果实，表面黄色，坚硬，具短细毛，有脉5条。基部有白色线形的浆片2枚，长约2毫米，其中由一个浆片的内侧伸出1～3条淡黄色弯曲的须根（初生根）。剥去外稃，内含白米1粒，质坚，断面白色，有粉性。气无，味微甘。以粒饱满、均匀、色黄、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-ddiz829","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-ddiz829","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含淀粉、蛋白质、脂肪、淀粉酶及维生素等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-0l0ou89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-0l0ou89","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】炒谷芽：置锅内用文火炒至深黄色并大部爆裂，取出放凉。焦谷芽：将谷芽置锅内，用武火炒至焦黄色，微喷清水，取出风干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-eb6fnpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-eb6fnpd","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-bu4qicy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-bu4qicy","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-55z5q0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-55z5q0h","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"甘，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-ema4y3a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-ema4y3a","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"味苦，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-8hryzam","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-8hryzam","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-sewvqo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-sewvqo7","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入脾、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-myofxtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-myofxtp","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草汇言》：\"通入脾、胃二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-5iaszmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-5iaszmv","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经解》：\"入足厥阴肝经，手少阴心经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-oejcnf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-oejcnf9","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》：\"入脾、肺二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-ryjks2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-ryjks2l","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-9hhrczw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-9hhrczw","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"健脾开胃，和中消食。治宿食不化，胀满，泄泻，不思饮食。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-z81j2r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-z81j2r1","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"快脾开胃，下气和中，消食化积。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-4ojvxti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-4ojvxti","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《食物本草会纂》：\"除烦消食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-2vnvzi2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-2vnvzi2","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《中药材手册》：\"治脾虚，心胃痛，胀满，热毒下痢，烦渴，消瘦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-9k0n05g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-9k0n05g","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3～5钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-so50k1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-so50k1b","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-brnbzjr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-brnbzjr","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①启脾进食：谷蘖四两，为末，入姜汁、盐少许，和作饼，焙干；入炙甘草、砂仁、白术（麸炒）各一两。为末，白汤点服之，或丸服。（《澹寮方》谷神丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-iacpkbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-iacpkbh","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②脾胃虚弱泄泻：茯苓、芡实、建曲、查肉、扁豆、泽泻、谷芽、甘草。（《麻疹集成》健脾止泻汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-vxrmmrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-vxrmmrt","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③消食，健脾，开胃，和中，生津液，益元气。治病后脾土不健者：谷芽蒸露，用以代茶。（《中国医学大辞典》谷芽露）"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-zyqnlx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-zyqnlx8","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】华北地区习惯以禾本科植物粟的颖果，发芽后作谷芽用。参见\"粟芽\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-yk9r39f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-yk9r39f","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-1f29zx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-1f29zx2","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谷芽《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-egstm8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-egstm8y","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草纲目》。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-302vf5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-302vf5r","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】GǔYá"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-ifd5nht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-ifd5nht","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】Rice-grainSprout,MilletSprout"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-dmtobwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-dmtobwg","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】蘖米、谷蘖、稻蘖、稻芽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-jmz20jg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-jmz20jg","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-7xen91z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-7xen91z","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为禾本科植物稻的颖果经发芽而成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-d7xs5sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-d7xs5sw","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：OryzasativaL."}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-03lakp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-03lakp2","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】稻一年生栽培植物。秆直立，丛生，高约1m左右。叶鞘无毛，下部者长于节间；叶舌膜质而较硬，披针形，基部两侧下延与叶鞘边缘相结合，长5-25mm，幼时具明显的叶耳；叶片扁平，披针形至条状披针形，长30-60cm，宽6-15cm。圆锥花序疏松，成熟时向下弯曲，分枝具角棱，常粗糙；小穗长圆形，两侧压扁，长6-8mm，含3小花，下方两小花退化仅存极小的外稃而位于1两性小花之下；颖极退化，在小穗柄之顶端呈半月形的痕迹；退化外稃长3-4mm，两性小花外稃，有5脉，常具细毛，有芒或无芒，内稃3脉，亦被细毛；鳞被2，卵圆形，长1mm；雄蕊6；花药长2mm；花柱2枚，筒短，柱头帚刷状，自小花两侧伸出。颖果平滑。花、果期6-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-s5ayyl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-s5ayyl4","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-upk3lku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-upk3lku","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：我国南北各地均有水稻的栽培区。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-t4cn8nw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-t4cn8nw","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：我国南北各地均有水稻的栽培区。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-anu1e2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-anu1e2e","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-zuxqm4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-zuxqm4v","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材鉴别性状鉴别果实呈稍扁的长椭圆形，两端略尖，长6-9mm，宽约3mm。外种坚硬，表面黄色，具短细毛，有脉5条。基部有白色线形的浆片2枚，长约2mm，淡黄色，膜质，由一侧的浆片内伸出淡黄色弯曲的初生根。内释薄膜状，光滑，黄白色，内藏果实，质坚，断面白色，有粉性。气无，味微甜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-kbtze9i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-kbtze9i","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别粉末特征：黄白色。①胚乳细胞含有淀粉粒，单粒呈不规则的多角形，边缘尖锐，直径2-10μm，偶见凹形脐点，层纹不明显，复粒由多数单粒组成，全角多呈卵圆形。②外稃上可见单细胞非腺毛，长150-250μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-q4rtxj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-q4rtxj2","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理化鉴别（l）取本品粉末2g，加水4ml置乳钵中研磨，静置片刻，吸取上层清液，滤过。滤液点于滤纸上，喷洒前三酮试剂，在100℃左右的供箱中，放置l-2min，呈现紫色斑块。（2）取上述的水提取液，点于滤纸上，喷洒苯胺一邻苯二甲酸试剂，在105℃烘5min，呈现棕色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-007c3iq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-007c3iq","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含蛋白质、脂肪油、淀粉、淀粉酶、麦芽糖（maltose），腺嘌呤（adenine），胆碱（choline）以及天冬氨酸（asparticacid），γ-氨基丁酸（γ-aminobutyricacid）等18种氨基酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-pryfd3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-pryfd3l","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】本品所含的β-淀粉酶能将糖淀粉完全水解成麦芽糖，α淀粉酶则使之分解成短直链缩合葡萄糖，但本品所含的α-和β-淀粉酶量较少，其消化淀粉的功能不及麦芽。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-qv7romy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-qv7romy","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-gd8mpce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-gd8mpce","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.取拣净的稻谷，用水浸泡1-2天，捞出置容器中，上盖潮湿蒲包，每日淋水，保持湿润，至初生根（俗称芽）长约3-6mm时，取出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-09l4x6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-09l4x6i","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.炒谷芽：置锅内用文火炒至深黄色并大部爆裂，取出放凉。焦谷芽：将谷芽置锅内，用武火炒至焦黄色，微喷清水，取出风干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-e7b9nxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-e7b9nxp","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；平"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-fnfxo8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-fnfxo8h","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归脾；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-7gblhem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-7gblhem","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】消食化积；健脾开胃。主食品店积停滞；胀满泄泻；脾虚少食；脚气浮肿"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-4k2mew2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-4k2mew2","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，10-15g，大剂量30g；或研末。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-u0xoxio","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-u0xoxio","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】《四川中药志》1960年版：“胃下垂者忌用。”"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-3bzjl5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-3bzjl5q","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-hnd56f6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-hnd56f6","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草经疏》：蘖米即稻蘖也。具生化之性，故为消食健脾、开胃和中之要药，脾胃和则中自瘟，气自下，热自除也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-ozbdvtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-ozbdvtb","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经逢原》：谷芽，启脾进食，宽中消谷，而能补中，不似麦芽之克削也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-4tj9c7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-4tj9c7q","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草纲目》：快脾开胃，下气和中，消食化积。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-e3fji85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-e3fji85","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《食物本草会纂》：除烦消食。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-g9fd7k9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-g9fd7k9","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《中药材手册》：治脾虚，心胃痛，胀满，热毒下痢，烦渴，消瘦。"}]},{"ID":"20240902174549-std3tvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174549-std3tvi","updated":"20240902174555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902174551-w7cy04g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902174551-w7cy04g","updated":"20240902174555"}},{"ID":"20240902174551-78a150j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902174551-78a150j","updated":"20240902174555"}}]}